BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Florida Project
DTSTART:20250904T010000Z
DTEND:20250904T031500Z
DTSTAMP:20250904T010000Z
UID:jORvnGHgO2
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 115 mins (1h55m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club Warm\, winning\,
  and gloriously alive\, Sean Baker’s The Florida Project is a deeply mov
 ing and unforgettably poignant look at childhood.  Introduced by SIFF Cin
 ema Lead Hari Chitturi.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/siff-m
 ovie-club/the-florida-project
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Green Room
DTSTART:20251002T010000Z
DTEND:20251002T025500Z
DTSTAMP:20251002T010000Z
UID:g1OjoVw2NO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 94 mins (1h34m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club Green Room is a b
 rilliantly crafted and wickedly fun horror-thriller starring Patrick Stewa
 rt as a diabolical club owner who squares off against an unsuspecting but 
 resilient young punk band. Introduced by SIFF Cinema Assistant Manager Ton
 y Ochoa.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/siff-movie-club/green
 -room
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Ascent
DTSTART:20251106T020000Z
DTEND:20251106T041000Z
DTSTAMP:20251106T020000Z
UID:nZf50CJ5pm
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 109 mins (1h49m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club Shepitko’s emo
 tionally overwhelming final film won the Golden Bear at the 1977 Berlin Fi
 lm Festival and has been hailed around the world as the finest Soviet film
  of its decade. Set during World War II's darkest days\, The Ascent follow
 s the path of two peasant soldiers\, cut off from their troop\, who trudge
  through the snowy backwoods of Belarus seeking refuge among villagers. Th
 eir harrowing trek leads them on a journey of betrayal\, heroism\, and ult
 imate transcendence.  Introduced by SIFF Cinema Staff Member Adam Plesser
 .\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/siff-movie-club/the-ascent
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
